9-astros-on-brink-of-elimination-after-6-3-loss-to-white-sox-in-game-one-of-wild-card-series","slug:2026-09-29-astros-on-brink-of-elimination-after-6-3-loss-to-white-sox-in-game-one-of-wild-card-series","keyword:keywords/White Sox","keyword:keywords/Wild Card","keyword:keywords/Houston Astros","keyword:keywords/elimination","keyword:keywords/Game one","keyword:keywords/postseason","author:user"]}},{"id":"%2F6abc6a4785f64ccbb0cb5da9","type":"PUBLISHING","record":{"ref_id":"%2F6abc6a4785f64ccbb0cb5da9","type":"content","payload":{"amp_enabled":true,"apple_news":null,"author":"Andre Perrard","blocks":[{"html":"\u003cp>The Brazoria County Sheriff's Office making a somber announcement on Tuesday evening, confirming the son of Sheriff Bo Stallman, Austin Stallman, has died after a heatstroke.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>Stallman suffered the heatstroke two weeks ago during a training program in College Station. He had been battling the effects ever since then.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>The department thanked the community for the outpouring of support, saying &quot;we cannot thank you enough and we will never forget.&quot; They also ask to continue supporting the Stallman family through this tragedy.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>Austin Stallman was a senior at Texas A&amp;M University, and attended Angleton High School.\u003c/p>\n\n","schedule":{},"type":"html"},{"attributes":{"mimetype":"image/jpeg","type":"image"},"bucket":"new_assets","caption":"","id":"%2F6abc6b6785f64ccbb0cb5db3","new_tab":false,"schedule":{},"source_credit":"Brazoria County Sheriff's Office","title":"","type":"asset","url":"","use_caption":false}],"canonical_url":"https://ktrh.iheart.com/featured/houston-texas-news/content/2026-09-29-son-of-brazoria-county-sheriff-bo-stallman-dies-after-heatstroke-during-training/","cuser":"user/ldap/1135944","enable_featured_widget":true,"exclusion":{"tags":[]},"external_url":"","fb_allow_comments":true,"featured_widget":{"country":"","id":"","kind":"","related_id":""},"feed_content_id":