:/6abbe5e9c15f1b0fe780cc6f","slug:2026-09-29-illegal-alien-charged-following-ice-shooting","slug:2026-09-29-illegal-alien-charged-following-ice-shooting","author:user"]}},{"id":"%2F6ababd798dfca9b4a8cfbc8b","type":"PUBLISHING","record":{"ref_id":"%2F6ababd798dfca9b4a8cfbc8b","type":"content","payload":{"amp_enabled":true,"apple_news":null,"author":"Ethan Buchanan","blocks":[{"attributes":{"mimetype":"image/jpeg","type":"image"},"bucket":"new_assets","caption":"WASHINGTON, DC - MAY 15: Rep. Steve Cohen (D-TN) gestures during a news conference in his office on Capitol Hill on May 15, 2026 in Washington, DC. Unless a court challenge blocks a new GOP-friendly Tennessee redistricting map that would split the state's","id":"%2F6ababd878dfca9b4a8cfbc94","new_tab":false,"schedule":{},"source_credit":"Getty Images North America","title":"Rep. Steve Cohen (D-TN) Announces His Retirement From Congress","type":"asset","url":"","use_caption":false},{"html":"\u003cp>\u003cstrong>Democrat Representative Steve Cohen, who is set to leave Congress in January thanks to redistricting, has filed twenty-six articles of impeachment against President Trump, following the path of Houston-area representative Al Green, who has also attempted to impeach both President Trump and members of his administration.\u003c/strong>\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>According to a \u003ca href=\"https://www.breitbart.com/border/2026/09/26/preview-of-a-midterm-reckoning-house-democrat-drops-massive-26-article-impeachment-resolution-against-trump/?shem=aimgspe\" target=\"_blank\">report on Cohen’s charges by Breitbart’s Bob Price\u003c/a>, these charges range from “Undermining Democracy” to simply canceling federal grants. In Article 6, Cohen claims Trump canceled certain grants specifically to punish certain states for how they’ve voted.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>Now Price is predicting that you can expect more impeachment attempts if the Democrats reclaim Congress in November. He warned: “The Democrats have told us time and time again who they are, and what the next Congress will look like if they take control. That will be ‘impeach Trump.’”\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>Price went on to predict that constantly attempting to impeach the President would just be the beginning, and the end goal of their plan would look a lot like the DSA party platform. “These rabid Democrats want to go full-on communist. They want to change the entire structure of the United States government to move forward with their agenda.”\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>He also says key successes the Trump administration has already achieved, especially on issues like border security, would also be rolled back in short order.\u003c/p>\n\n","schedule":{},"type":"html"}],"canonical_url":"https://ktrh.iheart.com/featured/houston-texas-news/content/2026-09-28-expect-more-impeachment-attempts-from-democrats-if-they-claim-the-house-in-november/","cuser":"user/ldap/1136533","enable_featured_widget":true,"exclusion":{"tags":[]},"external_url":"","fb_allow_comments":true,"featured_widget":{"country":"","id":"","kind":"","related_id":""},"feed_content_id":"","feed_partner_content":false,"feed_permalink":"","feed_type":"","feed_vendor":"","include_recommendations":true,"include_video_monetization":true,"is_sponsored":false,"keywords":[],"primary_image":{"bucket":"new_assets","id":"%2F6ababd878dfca9b4a8cfbc94"},"primary_target":{"categories":["categories/local-news"],"distribution":["brands/Houston & Texas News","brands/San Antonio's First News","brands/KTRH-AM (700)","brands/WOAI-AM (1229)","brands/KFXR-AM (7513)"]},"publish_date":1790694000000,"publish_end_date":4115978604802,"publish_origin":"brands/Houston & Texas News","seo_title":"Expect More Impeachment Attempts From Democrats If They Claim The House","show_updated_timestamp":false,"simplereach_enabled":false,"slug":"2026-09-28-expect-more-impeachment-attempts-from-democrats-if-they-claim-the-house-in-november","social_title":"Expect More Impeachment Attempts From Democrats If They Claim The House In November","summary":"Democrat Representative Steve Cohen, who is set to leave Congress in January thanks to redistricting, has filed twenty-six articles of impeachment against President Trump. ","targets":[],"title":"Expect More Impeachment Attempts From Democrats If They Claim The House In November","permalink":"https://ktrh.iheart.com/featured/houston-texas-news/content/2026-09-28-expect-more-impeachment-attempts-from-democrats-if-they-claim-the-house-in-november/"},"slug":"2026-09-28-expect-more-impeachment-attempts-from-democrats-if-they-claim-the-house-in-november","summary":{"image":"https://i.iheart.com/v3/re/new_assets/6ababd878dfca9b4a8cfbc94","title":"Expect More Impeachment Attempts From Democrats If They Claim The House In November","description":"Democrat Representative Steve Cohen, who is set to leave Congress in January thanks to redistricting, has filed twenty-six articles of impeachment against President Trump. ","author":"Ethan Buchanan"},"pub_start":1790694000000,"pub_until":4115978604802,"pub_changed":1790694000000,"subscription":[{"tags":["categories/local-news","brands/Houston & Texas News","brands/San Antonio's First News","brands/KTRH-AM (700)","brands/WOAI-AM (1229)","brands/KFXR-AM (7513)"]}],"exclusion":[{"tags":[]}],"linksData":[],"lookup":["publish_origin:brands/Houston & Texas News","id:/6ababd798dfca9b4a8cfbc8b","slug:2026-09-28-expect-more-impeachment-attempts-from-democrats-if-they-claim-the-house-in-november","slug:2026-09-28-expect-more-impeachment-attempts-from-democrats-if-they-claim-the-house-in-november","author:user"]}},{"id":"%2F6abac7f6ec8fcaa9a9382749","type":"PUBLISHING","record":{"ref_id":"%2F6abac7f6ec8fcaa9a9382749","type":"content","payload":{"amp_enabled":true,"apple_news":null,"author":"B.D. Hobbs","blocks":[{"attributes":{"mimetype":"image/jpeg","type":"image"},"bucket":"assets.getty","caption":"WASHINGTON, DC - SEPTEMBER 29: Former Special Counsel Jack Smith prepares to testify during a hearing before the Senate Judiciary Committee in the Hart Senate Office Building on September 29, 2026 in Washington, DC. The committee is holding the hearing to examine Smith's probe into Donald Trump. (Photo by Win McNamee/Getty Images)","id":"%2F6abbc0f5fc134699aa44ff0f","new_tab":false,"schedule":{},"source_credit":"Win McNamee / Getty Images News / Getty Images","title":"Former Special Counsel Jack Smith Testifies Before Senate Judiciary Committee","type":"asset","url":"","use_caption":false},{"html":"\u003cp>Former Special Counsel Jack Smith testifies Tuesday for of the Senate Judiciary Committee about his 'Arctic Frost' investigation. Committee Chair Chuck Grassley revealed that Smith also spied on 50 journalist, including Fox News employees\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>In 2022, under Joe Biden's weaponized DOJ, Merrick Garland brought in Smith to go after President Trump and Republicans.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>&quot;Now is the time to hold his feet to the fire, from the Senate's perspective&quot; said Kaelan Deese, Justice Department reporter for the Washington Examiner who is covering the hearing.\u003cbr />Smith, who was found to be appointed illegally, subpoenaed phone records of multiple GOP lawmakers during the Arctic Frost investigation.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>&quot;There's a lot of elements to what Smith was doing that was considered sketchy by most&quot; Deese told KTRH, &quot;Hopefully, this can be a message to the Democratic party that if you go after a former president, that there has to be some sort of accountability.&quot;\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>Republicans and conservatives across the country have been waiting for years for accountability and justice, after the true lawlessness that happened under Biden.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>&quot;This hearing is extremely important, and I think you can call it a capstone on what the House and the Senate have been doing, as far as their retrospective investigation into Jack Smith and getting some retribution for what happened against conservatives&quot; noted Deese.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>Congressman Jim Jordan and the House Judiciary Committee hit Jack Smith with a criminal referral back in July.\u003c/p>\n\n","schedule":{},"type":"html"},{"attributes":{"@provider":"Twitter","@query":"https://publish.twitter.com/oembed?format=json&omit_script=true&omitscript=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FRNCResearch%2Fstatus%2F2104929229897130139%3Fs%3D20","@url":"https://x.com/RNCResearch/status/2104929229897130139?s=20","author_name":"RNC Research","author_url":"https://x.com/RNCResearch","cache_age":"3153600000","height":null,"html":"\u003cblockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\">\u003cp lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">.\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/ChuckGrassley?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@ChuckGrassley\u003c/a> calls out Jack Smith for weaponizing the DOJ against Republicans:\u003cbr>\u003cbr>“Mr. Smith subpoenaed and obtained information on Republican groups as early as 2019 and as late as 2023…they were aware of constitutional speech and debate clause concerns.” \u003ca href=\"https://t.co/nxJ9tANdaD\">pic.twitter.com/nxJ9tANdaD\u003c/a>\u003c/p>&mdash; RNC Research (@RNCResearch) \u003ca href=\"https://x.com/RNCResearch/status/2104929229897130139?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">September 29, 2026\u003c/a>\u003c/blockquote>\n\n","provider_name":"X","provider_url":"https://x.com","thumbnail_height":0,"thumbnail_url":"","thumbnail_width":0,"title":"","type":"rich","url":"https://x.com/RNCResearch/status/2104929229897130139","version":"1.0","width":550},"embed_type":"rich","html":"\u003cblockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\">\u003cp lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">.\u003ca href=\"https://x.com/ChuckGrassley?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">@ChuckGrassley\u003c/a> calls out Jack Smith for weaponizing the DOJ against Republicans:\u003cbr>\u003cbr>“Mr. Smith subpoenaed and obtained information on Republican groups as early as 2019 and as late as 2023…they were aware of constitutional speech and debate clause concerns.” \u003ca href=\"https://t.co/nxJ9tANdaD\">pic.twitter.com/