 investigating an officer-involved shooting in Spring Branch after officers opened fire on an armed suspect Monday night ","author":""},"pub_start":1790673819567,"pub_until":4115978604802,"pub_changed":1790673823885,"subscription":[{"tags":["categories/local-news","brands/KTRH-AM (700)","brands/KPRC-AM (676)","brands/Houston & Texas News"]}],"exclusion":[{"tags":[]}],"linksData":[],"lookup":["publish_origin:brands/Houston & Texas News","id:/6abb6f7e693aa330ff86b63a","slug:2026-09-29-armed-suspect-shot-by-houston-police-in-spring-branch","slug:2026-09-29-armed-suspect-shot-by-houston-police-in-spring-branch"]}},{"id":"%2F6aba9dbaec8fcaa9a9382735","type":"PUBLISHING","record":{"ref_id":"%2F6aba9dbaec8fcaa9a9382735","type":"content","payload":{"amp_enabled":true,"apple_news":null,"author":"B.D. Hobbs","blocks":[{"html":"\u003cp>So just how radical has the left really become? There's a shocking new survey out that found that nearly half of Democrats - 44%, say they're ok with violence to stop President Trump.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>And we all know what they mean by 'violence'.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>&quot;What is violence to stop Trump? It means assassination, it implies more than just protests and riots, and that's dangerous. That's insurrection&quot; said Dr. Brian Joondeph, political writer for American Thinker.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>A sad, but true commentary, on what our political discourse has devolved into.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>&quot;What happened to promoting your ideas? What happened to elections? Campaigning? And presenting a vision?&quot; Joondeph told KTRH.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>Unfortunately, that was all lost when Democrats lost to Trump the first time in 2016. And now, the left has taken their TDS - too far.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>&quot;Politically charged terms are being used very freely to describe political opponents&quot; noted Joondeph, &quot;How many times has Trump been called Hitler? And Trump supporters are Nazi's? It's very dangerous, and it fans the flames. Look what we have seen.&quot;\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>We've seen two assassination attempts against President Trump, plus multiple threats that have been thwarted.\u003c/p>\n\n\u003cp>The study also found that there are growing concerns of political violence after the midterms.\u003c/p>\n\n","schedule":{},"type":"html"},{"attributes":{"@provider":"YouTube","@query":"https://www.youtube.com/oembed?format=json&omit_script=true&omitscript=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fyoutu.be%2F5dWHJZisp_s%3Fsi%3DVToMVRPtxyKopBVr","@url":"https://youtu.be/5dWHJZisp_s?si=VToMVRPtxyKopBVr","author_name":"News24","author_url":"https://www.youtube.com/@news24","height":113,"html":"\u003ciframe width=\"200\" height=\"113\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5dWHJZisp_s?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen title=\"Shock survey finds nearly half of Democrats back violence to stop Trump from being president\">\u003c/iframe>","provider_name":"YouTube","provider_url":"https://www.youtube.com/","thumbnail_height":360,"thumbnail_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5dWHJZisp_s/hqdefault.jpg","thumbnail_width":480,"title":"Shock survey finds nearly half of Democrats back violence to stop Trump from being president","type":"video","version":"1.0","width":200},"embed_type":"video","html":"\u003ciframe width=\"200\" height=\"113\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5dWHJZisp_s?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen title=\"Shock survey finds nearly half of Democrats back violence to stop Trump from being president\">\u003c/iframe>","provider":"YouTube","rendering_hint":"default","schedule":{},"type":"embed","url":"https://youtu.be/5dWHJZisp_s?si=VToMVRPtxyKopBVr"},{"attribute